    }
    Rider --> Trip : initiates
    Driver --> Trip : fulfills
```

**TripStatus enum:**

```java
enum TripStatus {
    REQUESTED, ACCEPTED, IN_PROGRESS, COMPLETED, CANCELLED
}
```

**DriverStatus enum:**

```java
enum DriverStatus {
    AVAILABLE, BUSY, OFFLINE
}
```

